hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"473","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Abu Bakr ke sath baithe hue thay, aur ye us waqt tha jab khajoor ke shagofe ka pehli martaba zahoor hua tha, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne ek shagofa dekha jo Madina me dekha gaya pehla shagofa tha to wo khush hue aur kaha: Shagofa! To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Ae Allah, hum se koi bhalai na cheen jo Tune hamein ata farmai hai ya jo Tune hamein ata farmaya hai us me se koi bhalai."
"474","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat me noe phal pesh kiya jata to Aap use apni aankhon par rakhte, phir us me se kuch tanawul farmate, phir farmate: Ae Allah, jaisa Tune hamein is ka awwal khilaya hai hamein is ka aakhir bhi khila aur is me hamare liye barkat ata farma."
"475","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Asim aur Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ibn Hazim se, Yunus al-Ayli se, Ibn Shihab se ke jab bhi Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat me noe phal pesh kiya jata to Aap use bosa dete aur use apni aankhon par rakhte."
